          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu luya olw'okuliya ghaaligho ekisenge kye baakookera ku kisasi ky'ongiriramu mu luya, nga kiriku olwigi olwigulira mu kisasi ekyo ekyali ku mulyango ogw'oku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba. Mu kisenge ekyo mwe baanaalizanga ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa byonabyona okuwaagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mu kisenge ekyo mwalimu emeeza ibiri ibiri ku luuyi ni ku luuyi. Ku meeza edho kwe baitiranga ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa byonabyona okuwaagho, n'ebigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'ebigheebwayo ng'omutango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ni kuliya okw'ekisenge ekyo, woona ghaaligho emeeza ibiri ibiri ku luuyi ni ku luuyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitegeeza nti munda mu kisenge ekyo kye baakookera ku kisasi ky'ongiriramu mu luya, mwalimu emeeza ina. Ni kuliya ku luuyi olw'omulyango yaabaayo emeeza ina. Woonawoona dhaaba nga dhiri meeza munaana, kwe baitiranga ebigheebwayo ng'omusengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaaligho n'emeeza edhindi ina, dhe baategekerangaku ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa byonabyona okuwaagho, nga baadhikola mu mabaale amabaadhe. Mu bugungumavu nga buli ndala egheza sentimita amakumi ataanu, ate mu bugazi yaagheza sentimita nsanvu na itaanu ku ndhuyi dhaayo dhoonadhoona. Ku meeza edho kwe baatanga ebintu bye baakozesanga mu kwita ebigheebwayo ng'omusengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kisenge ekyo mwalimu amalobo ge baakomereramu okukyezunguluza, nga mu buleeyi gaagayaga n'ekyala eky'omuntu. Ate ku meeza nga kwe bata emamba ey'ebigheebwayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
